      "dcterms:description": "{\"action\":\"\",\"actor\":\"\",\"alternative_quotes\":[],\"applies_to\":[],\"assertion_ids\":[\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:c127350f9a41feac33637358d677366a5a94638a76c50ff6268aa7715c99ac31\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:7c7a670c379ee3c3a4209a3e69f5f4dd9c0201c8e8e176aeb6e6a5f815b52db1\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:72ea648deeb10eea5370ae5e87b2513a6ae92978593c7c81e538143f51f4d488\"],\"choice_quote\":\"\",\"choice_text\":\"\",\"claimants\":[],\"concepts\":[],\"context_quotes\":[],\"defined_terms\":[],\"effective_periods\":[],\"end\":2155,\"evidence\":[{\"end\":2155,\"field\":\"summary\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A26bf1a2bb4a435dfac4c95beee0b11ea78bab22ac670bb65754c9e2393e34023:1295:2155:sha256-6d281e1a3ae35a74378374e7c95865690e52601a166451d298230a59e8033c2b\",\"quote\":\"The Community Services Block Grant Act, comprising this chapter, was originally enacted by subtitle B of Pub. L. 97–35, title VI, Aug. 13, 1981, 95 Stat. 511, and amended by Pub. L. 97–115, Dec. 29, 1981, 95 Stat. 1595; Pub. L. 98–288, May 21, 1984, 98 Stat. 189; Pub. L. 98–558, Oct. 30, 1984, 98 Stat. 2878; Pub. L. 99–425, Sept. 30, 1986, 100 Stat. 966; Pub. L. 101–501, Nov. 3, 1990, 104 Stat. 1222; Pub. L. 101–624, Nov. 28, 1990, 104 Stat. 3359; Pub. L. 103–94, Oct. 6, 1993, 107 Stat. 1001; Pub. L. 103–171, Dec. 2, 1993, 107 Stat. 1988; Pub. L. 103–252, May 18, 1994, 108 Stat. 623. The Community Services Block Grant Act is shown herein, however, as having been added by Pub. L. 105–285, title II, § 201, Oct. 27, 1998, 112 Stat. 2728, without reference to those intervening amendments because of the extensive revision of that Act by Pub. L. 105–285.\",\"start\":1295}],\"id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:087075ea5a3d5b64694fc2e9bd2cfd76d4dff16a7b10a9ab6365853bae6b1fbf\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"kind\":\"statement\",\"logic_text\":\"\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:72ea648deeb10eea5370ae5e87b2513a6ae92978593c7c81e538143f51f4d488\",\"modality\":\"not_stated\",\"modality_quote\":\"\",\"object\":\"\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:454a8e1721a18dab5b5d7b2641cb95d7044f47571270ab5995515059a6107669\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"The Community Services Block Grant Act, comprising this chapter, was originally enacted by subtitle B of Pub. L. 97–35, title VI, Aug. 13, 1981, 95 Stat. 511, and amended by Pub. L. 97–115, Dec. 29, 1981, 95 Stat. 1595; Pub. L. 98–288, May 21, 1984, 98 Stat. 189; Pub. L. 98–558, Oct. 30, 1984, 98 Stat. 2878; Pub. L. 99–425, Sept. 30, 1986, 100 Stat. 966; Pub. L. 101–501, Nov. 3, 1990, 104 Stat. 1222; Pub. L. 101–624, Nov. 28, 1990, 104 Stat. 3359; Pub. L. 103–94, Oct. 6, 1993, 107 Stat. 1001; Pub. L. 103–171, Dec. 2, 1993, 107 Stat. 1988; Pub. L. 103–252, May 18, 1994, 108 Stat. 623. The Community Services Block Grant Act is shown herein, however, as having been added by Pub. L. 105–285, title II, § 201, Oct. 27, 1998, 112 Stat. 2728, without reference to those intervening amendments because of the extensive revision of that Act by Pub. L. 105–285.\",\"references\":[],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:25a378121cada00108bd975ac43d62850e363a01da86bd2ef26689636b390a24\",\"scope_quotes\":[],\"scope_text\":\"\",\"section_id\":\"\",\"start\":1295,\"summary\":\"The Community Services Block Grant Act, comprising chapter 106, was originally enacted by subtitle B of Pub. L. 97–35 (Aug. 13, 1981, 95 Stat. 511) and amended by several intervening public laws (Pub. L. 97–115, Pub. L. 98–288, Pub. L. 98–558, Pub. L. 99–425, Pub. L. 101–501, Pub. L. 101–624, Pub. L. 103–94, Pub. L. 103–171, and Pub. L. 103–252), but is shown herein as having been added by Pub. L. 105–285, title II, § 201 (Oct. 27, 1998, 112 Stat. 2728), without reference to those intervening amendments due to the extensive revision of that Act by Pub. L. 105–285.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"term_refs\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
