ccordance with this paragraph, States shall redistribute such funds to an eligible entity, or require the original recipient of the funds to redistribute the funds to a private, nonprofit organization, located within the community served by the original recipient of the funds, for activities consistent with the purposes of this chapter.\",\"start\":25848}],\"id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:7060dfb22d5606c7c0d7c6a21caba4feb4a2903a3e401999c7e1f8d7e5d5a96a\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"kind\":\"requirement\",\"logic_text\":\"\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:b43969d389c3b21a35720c164e4127ed3b6124e211af029dff9714b1f9ba55b4\",\"modality\":\"must\",\"modality_quote\":\"shall\",\"object\":\"\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:d3b28c90e6a3ebb589d9c8322a73e03f1b9a227cdd2ba227abadb9838b1eb886\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"In redistributing funds recaptured in accordance with this paragraph, States shall redistribute such funds to an eligible entity, or require the original recipient of the funds to redistribute the funds to a private, nonprofit organization, located within the community served by the original recipient of the funds, for activities consistent with the purposes of this chapter.\",\"references\":[],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:efad3a8dbbf86850f7d032223f5f87ceb983e011671d12bd02a52f15589f7f9a\",\"scope_quotes\":[\"In redistributing funds recaptured in accordance with this paragraph, States shall redistribute such funds to an eligible entity, or require the original recipient of the funds to redistribute the funds to a private, nonprofit organization, located within the community served by the original recipient of the funds, for activities consistent with the purposes of this chapter.\"],\"scope_text\":\"In redistributing funds recaptured in accordance with this paragraph.\",\"section_id\