d9fe9662da93756e0154f15470eb0b835\",\"quote\":\"In this subsection:\",\"start\":29267},{\"end\":29602,\"field\":\"defined_terms:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A26bf1a2bb4a435dfac4c95beee0b11ea78bab22ac670bb65754c9e2393e34023:29588:29602:sha256-5b7a5118168f01eb0c113c4a86fb8eaaf3152b12972bcf36b8bf52bf0f5a8c4f\",\"quote\":\"(i) In general\",\"start\":29588},{\"end\":29655,\"field\":\"defined_terms:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A26bf1a2bb4a435dfac4c95beee0b11ea78bab22ac670bb65754c9e2393e34023:29603:29655:sha256-947a908ff611bf4a7f430a1379bde16cb4fe0df727943aaab8c2b2f6579d5e1f\",\"quote\":\"The term “qualified charity” means any organization—\",\"start\":29603},{\"end\":29669,\"field\":\"defined_terms:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A26bf1a2bb4a435dfac4c95beee0b11ea78bab22ac670bb65754c9e2393e34023:29657:29669:sha256-d7b77f9839126bd88b3b4fc32031e3950006e7b20e147de8fcbc0ab8c4fc4f47\",\"quote\":\"(I) that is—\",\"start\":29657},{\"end\":30231,\"field\":\"defined_terms:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A26bf1a2bb4a435dfac4c95beee0b11ea78bab22ac670bb65754c9e2393e34023:29671:30231:sha256-3f63541a313fcb71e1c1d47649398f75a1d9b0b64af1f53bbdf49fcf83df329f\",\"quote\":\"(aa) described in section 501(c)(3) of title 26 and exempt from tax under section 501(a) of such title;\\n\\n(bb) an eligible entity; or\\n\\n(cc) a public housing agency as defined in section 1437a(b)(6) of this title;\\n\\n\\n(II) that is certified by the appropriate State authority as meeting the requirements of clauses (iii) and (iv); and\\n\\n(III) if such organization is otherwise required to file a return under section 6033 of such title, that elects to treat the information required to be furnished by clause (v) as being specified in section 6033(b) of such title.\",\"start\":29671},{\"end\":29586,\"field\":\"defined_terms:0:source:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A26bf1a2bb4a435dfac4c95beee0b11ea78bab22ac670bb65754c9e2393e34023:29565:29586:sha256-2b84fd73dab6ea848f45658cca91e2d77b1f28da65d33bfe0c05dbab463a4d83\",\"quote\":\"(B) Qualified charity\",\"start\":29565},{\"end\":29602,\"field\":\"defined_terms:0:source:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A26bf1a2bb4a435dfac4c95beee0b11ea78bab22ac670bb65754c9e2393e34023:29588:29602:sha256-5b7a5118168f01eb0c113c4a86fb8eaaf3152b12972bcf36b8bf52bf0f5a8c4f\",\"quote\":\"(i) In general\",\"start\":29588},{\"end\":29655,\"field\":\"defined_terms:0:source:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A26bf1a2bb4a435dfac4c95beee0b11ea78bab22ac670bb65754c9e2393e34023:29603:29655:sha256-947a908ff611bf4a7f430a1379bde16cb4fe0df727943aaab8c2b2f6579d5e1f\",\"quote\":\"The term “qualified charity” means any organization—\",\"start\":29603},{\"end\":29669,\"field\":\"defined_terms:0:source:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A26bf1a2bb4a435dfac4c95beee0b11ea78bab22ac670bb65754c9e2393e34023:29657:29669:sha256-d7b77f9839126bd88b3b4fc32031e3950006e7b20e147de8fcbc0ab8c4fc4f47\",\"quote\":\"(I) that is—\",\"start\":29657},{\"end\":30231,\"field\":\"defined_terms:0:source:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A26bf1a2bb4a435dfac4c95beee0b11ea78bab22ac670bb65754c9e2393e34023:29671:30231:sha256-3f63541a313fcb71e1c1d47649398f75a1d9b0b64af1f53bbdf49fcf83df329f\",\"quote\":\"(aa) described in section 501(c)(3) of title 26 and exempt from tax under section 501(a) of such title;\\n\\n(bb) an eligible entity; or\\n\\n(cc) a public housing agency as defined in section 1437a(b)(6) of this title;\\n\\n\\n(II) that is certified by the appropriate State authority as meeting the requirements of clauses (iii) and (iv); and\\n\\n(III) if such organization is otherwise required to file a return under section 6033 of such title, that elects to treat the information required to be furnished by clause (v) as being specified in section 6033(b) of such title.\",\"start\":29671}],\"id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:b631c9a2a069e069f818b9b5f24b220e50e0121ec16743f7e6245e11f06ed056\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"kind\":\"definition\",\"logic_text\":\"\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:ffd65cc252241cc5c2a82979adefe9b2286cf3d6ab9663b3270ce63ab08c1751\",\"modality\":\"not_stated\",\"modality_quote\":\"\",\"object\":\"\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:9bcdd589ca3b27fb15278e19cb26cd3bbfb5900d88c72c5afc52baba029bc466\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"(i) In general The term “qualified charity” means any organization—\\n\\n(I) that is—\\n\\n(aa) described in section 501(c)(3) of title 26 and exempt from tax under section 501(a) of such title;\\n\\n(bb) an eligible entity; or\\n\\n(cc) a public housing agency as defined in section 1437a(b)(6) of this title;\\n\\n\\n(II) that is certified by the appropriate State authority as meeting the requirements of clauses (iii) and (iv); and\\n\\n(III) if such organization is otherwise required to file a return under section 6033 of such title, that elects to treat the information required to be furnished by clause (v) as being specified in section 6033(b) of such title.\",\"references\":[\"section 501(c)(3)\",\"section 501(a)\",\"section 1437a(b)(6)\",\"clauses (iii)\",\"(iv)\",\"section 6033\",\"clause (v)\",\"section 6033(b)\"],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:9185d503979c7fd45346c4083608ff0008e6351b90bdc392e5ee3a8d29aab2fb\",\"scope_quotes\":[\"(3) Definitions and rules In this subsection:\"],\"scope_text\":\"In subsection (c).\",\"section_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:section:065d5bd1b1fd12e07012730aaa12714e330211d213042d09aad361bcfa67ebfa\",\"start\":29588,\"summary\":\"The term “qualified charity” means any organization that is described in section 501(c)(3) of title 26 and exempt from tax under section 501(a) of such title, an eligible entity, or a public housing agency as defined in section 1437a(b)(6) of this title; that is certified by the appropriate State authority as meeting the requirements of clauses (iii) and (iv); and, if such organization is otherwise required to file a return under section 6033 of such title, that elects to treat the information required to be furnished by clause (v) as being specified in section 6033(b) of such title.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"term_refs\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
