      "rkaf:assertsValue": {
        "@value": "In the case of a State that has a constitutional requirement of tax uniformity and that, as of December 31, 1997, imposed a tax on personal income with a single flat rate applicable to all earned and unearned income (except insofar as any amount is not taxed pursuant to tax forgiveness provisions) and no generally available exemptions or deductions to individuals.",
