cca7c9ab879554d52d6\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"(b) State application and plan Beginning with fiscal year 2000, to be eligible to receive a grant or allotment under section 9905 or 9906 of this title, a State shall prepare and submit to the Secretary an application and State plan covering a period of not less than 1 fiscal year and not more than 2 fiscal years. The plan shall be submitted not later than 30 days prior to the beginning of the first fiscal year covered by the plan, and shall contain such information as the Secretary shall require, including—\",\"references\":[\"section 9905\",\"section 9906\"],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:9ed5274bef636f8a74ba79d537ec0b33c8c5e0175eb7d7c36372bcec3c63b278\",\"scope_quotes\":[\"(b) State application and plan Beginning with fiscal year 2000, to be eligible to receive a grant or allotment under section 9905 or 9906 of this title, a State shall prepare and submit to the Secretary an application and State plan covering a period of not less than 1 fiscal year and not more than 2 fiscal years. The plan shall be submitted not later than 30 days prior to the beginning of the first fiscal year covered by the plan, and shall contain such information as the Secretary shall require, including—\"],\"scope_text\":\"Beginning with fiscal year 2000, to be eligible to receive a grant or allotment under section 9905 or 9906 of this title\",\"section_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:section:0b55006ce2c906add8328d3986f73bcd1ded9a87a908d01ae85b5595b9018d1b\",\"start\":37820,\"summary\":\"Beginning with fiscal year 2000, to be eligible to receive a grant or allotment under section 9905 or 9906 of this title, a State shall prepare and submit to the Secretary an application and State plan covering a period of not less than 1 fiscal year and not more than 2 fiscal years; the plan shall be submitted not later than 30 days prior to the beginning of the first fiscal year covered by the plan, and shall contain such information as the Secretary shall require, including the assurances and information specified in paragraphs (1) through (13).\",\"target_ids\":[],\"term_refs\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
