espond to—\\n\\n(i) the results of the most recently available census or other appropriate data;\\n\\n(ii) the designation of a new eligible entity; or\\n\\n(iii) severe economic dislocation; or\\n\\n\\n(B) the failure of an eligible entity to comply with the terms of an agreement or a State plan, or to meet a State requirement, as described in section 9915(a) of this title; and\"]}],\"effective_periods\":[],\"end\":47132,\"evidence\":[{\"end\":46508,\"field\":\"summary\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A26bf1a2bb4a435dfac4c95beee0b11ea78bab22ac670bb65754c9e2393e34023:46471:46508:sha256-d4f1bfddd0872a5183a6dbe2d364892802414a219f1484035e3935087ff59c1a\",\"quote\":\"(c) Funding termination or reductions\",\"start\":46471},{\"end\":46601,\"field\":\"summary\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A26bf1a2bb4a435dfac4c95beee0b11ea78bab22ac670bb65754c9e2393e34023:46509:46601:sha256-13a8d19add8f635f66ac3fe59c819acbf3bc3fbd052edca0c021af3b3e89cc78\",\"quote\":\"For purposes of making a determination in accordance with subsection (b)(8) with respect to—\",\"start\":46509},{\"end\":46654,\"field\":\"summary\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A26bf1a2bb4a435dfac4c95beee0b11ea78bab22ac670bb65754c9e2393e34023:46603:46654:sha256-c12577b5702dccfdc47e6d2666a875b63b5599537340d2278d0cff8a1cb2f846\",\"quote\":\"(1) a funding reduction, the term “cause” includes—\",\"start\":46603},{\"end\":46779,\"field\":\"summary\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A26bf1a2bb4a435dfac4c95beee0b11ea78bab22ac670bb65754c9e2393e34023:46656:46779:sha256-666f1bc31db8076ac930d96d12a392c08b0279bd05ce7c782415b07f67a4be46\",\"quote\":\"(A) a statewide redistribution of funds provided through a community services block grant under this chapter to respond to—\",\"start\":46656},{\"end\":47132,\"fiel