        "@value": "{\"actor\":\"the Secretary\",\"kind\":\"permission\",\"modality\":\"may\",\"summary\":\"The Secretary may prescribe by regulation criteria that a plan submitted by an Indian tribe or tribal organization for a fiscal year must meet in order for the tribe or organization to be eligible for a grant award for the fiscal year under this section.\"}",
