ot later than 30 days after receiving from an eligible entity a proposed quality improvement plan pursuant to subparagraph (A), either approve such proposed plan or specify the reasons why the proposed plan cannot be approved; and\",\"references\":[\"subparagraph (A)\"],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:5e852c4530f123ae19ee0407d89452e0e205330e38f18779fa1dcf5096c5d177\",\"scope_quotes\":[\"(B) not later than 30 days after receiving from an eligible entity a proposed quality improvement plan pursuant to subparagraph (A), either approve such proposed plan or specify the reasons why the proposed plan cannot be approved; and\"],\"scope_text\":\"Not later than 30 days after receiving from an eligible entity a proposed quality improvement plan pursuant to subparagraph (A)\",\"section_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:section:237b538fca368735fd9d07469584e65428d74fd94b694e39006074ead5c84559\",\"start\":69545,\"summary\":\"Not later than 30 days after receiving from an eligible entity a proposed quality improvement plan pursuant to subparagraph (A), the State shall either approve such proposed plan or specify the reasons why the proposed plan cannot be approved.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"term_refs\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
