        "@value": "{\"actor\":\"The Secretary\",\"kind\":\"requirement\",\"modality\":\"must\",\"summary\":\"The Secretary must provide technical assistance, including support for the enhancement of electronic data systems, to States and to eligible entities to enhance their capability to collect and report data for such a model performance measurement system and to aid in their participation in such a system.\"}",
