y shall submit to the Committee on Education and the Workforce of the House of Representatives and the Committee on Labor and Human Resources of the Senate the report described in paragraph (2), and any comments the Secretary may have with respect to such report. The report shall include definitions of direct and administrative costs used by the Department of Health and Human Services for programs funded under this chapter.\",\"references\":[\"paragraph (2)\"],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:9b058f33046d1396d4c1aec3974c7e7d089f7d690fe3e48d41fad1baf17abac3\",\"scope_quotes\":[],\"scope_text\":\"\",\"section_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:section:fa489a00ccb41098ac2b415167888ae0d85e530b88cc3c90eda7efe29c7dad7b\",\"start\":79135,\"summary\":\"The report described in paragraph (2) must include definitions of direct and administrative costs used by the Department of Health and Human Services for programs funded under 42 U.S.C. chapter 106.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"term_refs\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
