      "rkaf:assertsValue": {
        "@value": "Programs assisted under this chapter shall not be carried on in a manner involving the use of program funds, the provision of services, or the employment or assignment of personnel, in a manner supporting or resulting in the identification of such programs with: (A) any partisan or nonpartisan political activity or any political activity associated with a candidate, or contending faction or group, in an election for public or party office; (B) any activity to provide voters or prospective voters with transportation to the polls or similar assistance in connection with any such election; or (C) any voter registration activity.",
