        "@value": "{\"actor\":\"the Secretary\",\"kind\":\"requirement\",\"modality\":\"must\",\"scope_text\":\"Whenever the Secretary determines that a State that has received a payment under this chapter has failed to comply with paragraph (1) or an applicable regulation\",\"summary\":\"Whenever the Secretary determines that a State that has received a payment under this chapter has failed to comply with paragraph (1) or an applicable regulation, the Secretary shall notify the chief executive officer of the State and shall request that the officer secure compliance.\"}",
