      "rkaf:assertsValue": {
        "@value": "For any program carried out by the Federal Government, or by a State or local government under this chapter, the government must consider, on the same basis as other nongovernmental organizations, religious organizations to provide the assistance under the program, so long as the program is implemented in a manner consistent with the Establishment Clause of the first amendment to the Constitution.",
