      "rkaf:assertsPredicate": "urn:rulespec:document-understanding:states-requirement",
      "rkaf:assertsValue": {
        "@value": "Except as provided in paragraph (2) of subsection (d), any religious organization providing assistance under any program carried out by the Federal Government, or by a State or local government under this chapter, shall be subject to the same regulations as other nongovernmental organizations to account in accord with generally accepted accounting principles for the use of such funds provided under such program.",
