ted for their effectiveness. Funding for such evaluations shall be provided as a stated percentage of the assistance or through a separate grant awarded by the Secretary specifically for the purpose of evaluation of a particular activity or group of activities.\",\"references\":[\"subsection (b)\"],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:68e41ec726bb31cd937e6d89f4002724e1d867486a3c116fcbdde10e0f92b362\",\"scope_quotes\":[],\"scope_text\":\"\",\"section_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:section:6888d98c59cc2331f4c6a6a1e0052761ef3a8008658a9708c0cec6503ed121ed\",\"start\":94550,\"summary\":\"Funding for evaluations required under subsection (b) shall be provided as a stated percentage of the assistance or through a separate grant awarded by the Secretary specifically for the purpose of evaluation of a particular activity or group of activities.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"term_refs\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
