        "@value": "Of the amount appropriated for a fiscal year to carry out this section (but not to exceed $6,000,000), the Secretary shall allot for grants to eligible agencies for statewide programs in each State, from a portion equal to 60 percent of such amount (but not to exceed $3,600,000), the amount that bears the same ratio to such portion as the low-income and unemployed population of such State bears to the low-income and unemployed population of all the States.",
