his section is not less than $7,000,000 but less than $10,000,000;\\n\\n(ii) $20,000 if the total amount appropriated to carry out this section is not less than $10,000,000 but less than $15,000,000; or\",\"start\":101663},{\"end\":101657,\"field\":\"modality\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A26bf1a2bb4a435dfac4c95beee0b11ea78bab22ac670bb65754c9e2393e34023:101652:101657:sha256-56ee5b508706bf2de91712d85d6d1e11ddbff01949142ed6e8c22e3b1bed1c71\",\"quote\":\"shall\",\"start\":101652},{\"end\":101920,\"field\":\"scope_text:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A26bf1a2bb4a435dfac4c95beee0b11ea78bab22ac670bb65754c9e2393e34023:101790:101920:sha256-fb38e05da9465911705848c78245e0630849937380f76f906ef67a45290d95d2\",\"quote\":\"(ii) $20,000 if the total amount appropriated to carry out this section is not less than $10,000,000 but less than $15,000,000; or\",\"start\":101790}],\"id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:ff069309e8ca91d3cd3a24cfb8a3c3e0bbba6707bea4e23704c0bccaaf01c14a\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"kind\":\"requirement\",\"logic_text\":\"\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:ce417298e776d69453b889c5985a48b6ee5dd4e4e2d97d9ea564afc6dee3af48\",\"modality\":\"must\",\"modality_quote\":\"shall\",\"object\":\"\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:9cf8d2a29ea6a57b725196e0ff21b11e633fe2fd505666b05e1b2f1e30d4fd60\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"(A) In general From the amounts allotted under paragraphs (1)(A) and (2)(A), the minimum total allotment for each State for each fiscal year shall be—\\n\\n(i) $15,000 if the total amount appropriated to carry out this section is not less than $7,000,000 but less than $10,000,000;\\n\\n(ii) $20,000 if the total amount appropriated to carry out this section is not less than $10,000,000 but less than $15,000,000; or\",\"references\":[],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:bc52a9ed77079a4af220eb88986670e2e6bdc7cb5c39ca913b2d6206f3abd0bb\",\"scope_quotes\":[\"(ii) $20,000 if the total amount appropriated to carry out this section is not less than $10,000,000 but less than $15,000,000; or\"],\"scope_text\":\"if the total amount appropriated to carry out this section is not less than $10,000,000 but less than $15,000,000\",\"section_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:section:cad1a9ce814f7bc8d23a6ff48e1865a684b16830bcf049a10118a7b6cab89b15\",\"start\":101511,\"summary\":\"From the amounts allotted under paragraphs (1)(A) and (2)(A), the minimum total allotment for each State for each fiscal year shall be $20,000 if the total amount appropriated to carry out this section is not less than $10,000,000 but less than $15,000,000.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"term_refs\":[\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:term:550663f04290e4c0432d461c54153ca79b1a7845732eb11bb9eac015d4030f87\"],\"typed_values\":[]}",
