      "rkaf:assertsValue": {
        "@value": "For each fiscal year, the Secretary shall prepare and submit, to the Committee on Education and the Workforce of the House of Representatives and the Committee on Labor and Human Resources of the Senate, a report concerning the grants made under this section, which shall include: (1) a list of grant recipients; (2) information on the amount of funding awarded to each grant recipient; and (3) a summary of the activities performed by the grant recipients with funding awarded under this section and a description of the manner in which such activities meet the objectives described in subsection (a).",
