          "@type": "oa:TextQuoteSelector",
          "oa:exact": "(3) Not more than one grant in each fiscal year may be made to any eligible entity, and no grant may exceed $350,000. Not more than 2 grants may be made under this section to an eligible entity to carry out a particular program."
